Subject: [PATCH v2 29/44] cpuidle,tdx: Make tdx noinstr clean
References: <20220919095939.761690562@infradead.org>
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: loongarch@lists.linux.dev
List-Id: <loongarch.lists.linux.dev>
